  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KLTN.Game.Presentation.CardLoreProfile
  role: "H\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3"
  skillDescription: "[Chi ti\u1EBFt k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng]\r\n[Play]\r\n- Khi tri\u1EC7u
    h\u1ED3i ta, gi\u1EBFt m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ED3ng minh \u0111\u1EC3 r\xFAt 2 l\xE1."
  folklore: "Ta l\xE0 \xF4ng k\u1EB9 \u2014 nh\xE2n v\u1EADt v\xF4 h\xECnh ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
    l\u1EDBn d\xF9ng d\u1ECDa tr\u1EBB h\u01B0, hay kh\xF3c ho\u1EB7c \u0111i ch\u01A1i
    khuya. M\u1ED7i v\xF9ng k\u1EC3 h\xECnh d\xE1ng ta kh\xE1c nhau, nh\u01B0ng ta
    lu\xF4n r\xECnh ngo\xE0i t\u1ED1i \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EE9a tr\u1EBB
    kh\xF4ng nghe l\u1EDDi."
